### Variáveis (extensão REST Client para VS Code)
@host = http://localhost:3000

### 1) Criar conta (plano FREE por padrão)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/cadastro
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Teste", "email": "teste@email.com", "cpfCnpj": "24971563792", "senha": "123456" }

### 2) Login
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "teste@email.com", "senha": "123456" }

### 3) Quem sou eu
GET {{host}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 4) Dashboard
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 5) Relatório avançado (Premium)
GET {{host}}/api/relatorio
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 6) Assistente virtual (Premium)
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{ "message": "Qual aparelho consome mais energia?" }

### 7) Ingestão de leitura de dispositivo
POST {{host}}/api/readings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "device": "Ar-condicionado", "room": "Quarto", "day": "2026-11-10", "kwh": 7.2 }
